cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Dynamic-Dimensional-Reduction: a Lean 4 formalization, in progress, of Dynamic dimensional reduction in the Abelian sandpile"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 / mathlib formalization, in progress, of the paper "Dynamic
  dimensional reduction in the Abelian sandpile" (Bou-Rabee).  Every theorem,
  lemma, proposition and corollary of the paper is registered as a frozen
  statement, 20 in all.  The 10 results of Sections 2 and 3 are proved, with
  no custom axiom and no cited result taken as a hypothesis.  The other 10,
  the main theorem (dimensional reduction and self-similarity of the parallel
  toppling odometer), its corollary for the sandpile and the regularity
  proposition proved with them, are open, each a single registered sorry.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bou-Rabee
    given-names: Ahmed
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - Abelian sandpile
  - parallel toppling
  - dimensional reduction
license: Apache-2.0
